===Etymology===
Per Vasmer, from {{af|ru|висе́ть|t1=to [[hang]]|-о́к}}; original meaning (still found dialectally) "hair hanging at the temples". Compare {{cog|be|виска́та||[[slovenly]] [[woman]] with [[disheveled]] [[hair]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|висо́к}}
